# Commits of the CRAN line's release branch that `main` does without on purpose.
#
# scripts/series-check.sh reports every commit of that branch `main` has no
# counterpart of (FORWARD-PORT), and skips the ones listed here. Read from
# `main`. One per line: the commit's full SHA, then why `main` does not take it.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored; any other line that is
# not a SHA and a reason is named in the report and declines nothing.
#
# Handbook: /handbook/branches/model/README.md
